Subject: [PATCH] mhi_bus: controller: fix debugfs_simple_attr.cocci
 warnings
Message-ID: <alpine.DEB.2.20.1804280914120.2700@hadrien>
User-Agent: Alpine 2.20 (DEB 67 2015-01-07)
MIME-Version: 1.0
